XSTATS:
X
XStr (Strength):  Affects the damage you do and more to the point how much 
X   stuff you can pick up. You need a Str of 6 minimum to cast spells. To  
X   increase this stat, eat royal jelly, giant corpses, or wear gauntlets
X   of power.
X
XDex (Dexterity):  Affects the speed of your attacks and the how likely you 
X   are to hit.  Affects use of harp. To increase, use gauntlets of dexterity. 
X
XCon (Constitution):  High constitution gives you extra hit points whenever you 
X   go up a level.
X
XChr (Charisma):  Affects the prices a shopkeeper will give you in a shops, and 
X   adds to the chance of success with a succubus/incubus.  You can increase 
X   this with a ring of adornment. 
X
XWis (Wisdom):  This is what is taken into account when you pray to your god 
X   and the chance of getting something from a pilgrim. Increase this with a helm
X   of brilliance.
X
XInt (Intelligence):  Helps to determine whether you can transcribe a spell or,
X   more to the point, the chance that you'll be able to cast it. This is also
X   increased with a helm of brilliance.
