XGENERAL HINTS:
X
XTo stop a cockatrice from turning you to stone, eat a lizard corpse (which
X  will not spoil).
XTry using the #chat command to talk to Priests that you find in altar rooms.
XIt is a GREAT idea to give like-aligned priests 400*level in gold.
XIf you attack a rival priest in his temple, his god will fight for him, so
X  make it your temple first.(i.e. change altar).
XA guaranteed way to change your alignment is to kill of a unicorn of your
X  alignment and offer the fresh corpse at an altar of the god whose alignment
X  you wish to convert to.
XFriendly monsters may become tame if you give them the right food(use tripe).
XKicking an altar makes the gods angry.
XZombie and mummy corpses are already old corpses, so can't be sacrificed.
XThe bigger the sacrifice, the better the reward.
XEating a clove of garlic cures lycanthropy. Prayer does too.
XHeck, for that matter, drinking holy water does too!
XYou can use a wand of polymorph to polymorph objects.
XA ring of warning warns:  white, pink, red, ruby, purple, and run at black.
XKicking is great for killing monsters at low levels (Especially for Samurais
X  and priests).
XDON'T kick in shop doors that are closed for inventory.
XA wand of digging makes a quick way down.
XFill trapdoors with boulders.  You can also cross water this way.
XMake sure that you get a blessed scroll of charging with a wand of wishing.  
X  From one wand of wishing with three charges, you should get the scroll and 6 
X  wishes. 
X#r)ub every lamp you find: if you see a puff of smoke, bless it and try again.
XDipping items in potions of holy water blesses them if uncursed, uncurses if
X cursed.
XWhen dipping in holy water, amber means uncursed, light blue means blessed.
XDipping a corpse in holy water prolongs it.
XDipping a dart may identify a potion of sickness.(It coats the dart)
XBlessed weapons fight better against undead creatures.
XDipping a longsword into a fountain may turn it into Excalibur.
XAthames write 'Elbereth' very well.
XOne way to fight a superior human fighter is a potion of paralysis.   
XA helm of brilliance will add its defense bonus to your Int and Wis.
XA rod of cancellation cancels a monster's special effects.
XDon't use a rod of cancellation on yourself.
XTo make blank scrolls and water, use a wand of cancellation.
XTo use a wand on yourself, use period for the direction.
XBlessed magic lamps always give wishes if they have a charge.
XTo identify a gray stone, kick it.  Lodestones don't move.
XWhen you run into a great number of statues, DON'T look out.
XCursed and blessed wands function no differently from ordinary wands, except 
X  that cursed ones have a small chance of exploding when used.
XGive Juiblex as much money as he wants, unless you are very high level.
X  Also, he cannot be hurt by cockatrice corpses.
XZap monsters that engulf you with a wand of digging.
XTo find the mimics in a shop, walk in, then back out.
XWhile wearing a blindfold (with telepathy) apply a mirror in your own 
X   direction to figure out where the medusa or wizard is.  Need several tries.
XA pet can be restored to maximum hit points by throwing a potion of healing or 
X   a potion of extra healing at it.
XTo create a scroll with a magic marker just write the name of the scroll on a 
X   blank scroll (i.e. "magic mapping").
XIf you are wearing dragon armor and eat a chameleon you will become that dragon.
XUnicorn horns are useful for fixing a number of problems, especially when they 
X   are blessed. 
XBeing magic resistant prevents teleport traps from working properly.
XYou cannot pick up item while levitating, therefore it is not always good to
X   be levitating.  However, vampire lords levitate but can pick up objects.
XIf you want to stop levitating, just fly over a sink, and you will.
XThrow a potion of paralysis at the Wizard:  he can't reincarnate if he is 
X   still alive. 
XMirrors may be used to scare some monsters.  They also, of course, kill Medusa.
XAn instrument can be used to open the castle gates if the gods have told you
X   the correct tune.
XIf you cannot eat it now, tin it or freeze it.
XYou can wield a cockatrice corpse if you're wearing gloves, but don't go down 
X   stairs while carrying one, especially if you are overloaded. They are
